{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030121259810-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030145604\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（30日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該2處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該2處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:05:02.497813+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:12:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:13.159802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:01:19.545505+00:00","content_hash":"997cad337987b0b47da768d2dfff657b04749d3769b015b99877682af9b34817","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}